WEBVTT

NOTE
Illustrated menu-path guide. Not an actual screen recording.

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.750
Export your own first-degree LinkedIn connections. Email addresses depend on each member's settings.

2
00:00:06.750 --> 00:00:11.667
On LinkedIn desktop, choose Me, then Settings and Privacy.

3
00:00:11.667 --> 00:00:16.375
Choose Data privacy, then the option to get a copy of your data.

4
00:00:16.375 --> 00:00:22.750
Choose Connections if offered, or an archive including connections. Request the archive.

5
00:00:22.750 --> 00:00:29.250
Follow LinkedIn's notification to download the archive. Find the connections CSV inside.

6
00:00:29.250 --> 00:00:36.042
Import the connections file in Gold Mine Genie. Review who you know before planning personal outreach.
